00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:58.520
On August 18 2008, the same year of the crisis, during this theatrical chaos

00:01:58.520 --> 00:02:04.040
a domain or website appeared quietly on the Internet with the address Bitcoin.org

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:08.640
It was registered by an unknown person with an identity protected through the WhoisGuard service

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:12.480
No one knows who he/she is, nor what this site is exactly for

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:18.160
This was the case all along the first 72 days, then on October 31

00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:25.920
a crypto mailing list appeared on metzdowd.com announced by a person or group of people, no one knows,

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:36.560
under the pseudonym "Satoshi Nakamoto", they acclaimed that they had worked on a new fully functional electronic Peer-to-Peer monetary system

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:39.920
Through this system, a currency called Bitcoin will be

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:42.160
traded / exchanged among individuals directly and privately,

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:45.880
third parties are excluded as well as other central monitoring authority,

00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:51.040
and with the announcement, a file containing all the details was published called the “White Paper”,

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:54.280
which later became the Bitcoin Constitution

00:02:54.280 --> 00:02:58.680
This was the first appearance of the mysterious character of Satoshi Nakamoto on the Internet,

00:02:58.680 --> 00:03:03.920
and the first time the world knew about that new monetary system, as well as the entire process of currency production,

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:10.160
exchanging and dealing, through the "white paper", a 12-year-old written guide

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:17.640
that revolutionized the global financial system, a revolution that is still going on and its effect is increasing non-stop

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:23.240
The posts that were published under the name “Satoshi Nakamoto” in 2008 and 2009,

00:03:23.240 --> 00:03:27.720
explicitly stated that the reason for creating this digital monetary system

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:33.200
was mainly to remove external intermediaries who had to be present to make money transfers

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:37.240
Intermediaries, such as banks, credit card companies and others,

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:42.720
are the system lords who make huge profits annually from transaction fees,

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:47.600
unlike transactions in Bitcoin, which will be zero fees.

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:52.200
If we take a look at the net revenues of Visa company last year for example, in 2021,

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:59.600
revenues exceeded 24 billion dollars, an increase of 10% more than 2020

00:03:59.600 --> 00:04:05.360
Last August, the net revenues of the banking and investment services

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:09.880
giant JPMorgan exceeded 121 billion dollars in 12 months

00:04:09.880 --> 00:04:16.640
Another reason for bitcoin's innovation was the problems caused by traditional currencies

00:04:16.640 --> 00:04:23.160
exchanging that are being controlled by central banks that are controlling the wealth of nations in favor of a limited class as a result

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:28.720
Consequently, chaos or crises that occur in the monetary system due to financial institutions

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:35.840
mis-conduct is borne almost entirely by consumers and taxpayers, as happened in 2008

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:42.400
Central banks can also waste individuals’ savings if they decide to print money

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:49.040
in order to pay off their local debts for example. This in the long term leads to an increase in money circulation,

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:54.880
thus the inflation rate rises, consequently, squandering the value of individuals’ savings

00:04:54.880 --> 00:05:02.000
by reducing their purchasing power. The inevitable end of this series is the deterioration of their living standards as a result

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:06.680
On the contrary, in the Bitcoin monetary system, as a possible future alternative to traditional currencies,

00:05:06.680 --> 00:05:14.320
such problems and risks do not exist as there is neither third party in the transactions nor a central authority that

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:20.840
possesses tools through which individuals may be impoverished if those intermediaries mis-conduct

